ocations on the new planet giving  us more of an insight into the layout of  this new world and how people were  living there and apparently in another  deleted scene buzz would have gone  grocery shopping after he ran out of his  pre-assigned meals there was going to be  a joke where buzz asked for a packet of  dinner like the meal boxes he was used  to eating thus after his many years away  food has changed and he ended up being  sold something called pobbles which  mclean described as spiky space food the  concept art also has some references to  the green aliens who buzz first met at  pizza planet in toy story who's in  charge here  some fans have been disappointed they  didn't make an appearance in light year  especially as some of the little green  men worked for star command in the  animated series however mclean has  explained that he didn't think it made  sense for them to appear in light year a  movie that andy saw before the events of  toy story as the aliens don't know who  buzz is when he pops up in their claw  machine and toy story it fits that they  shouldn't have met him previously in the  new prequel movie maclean has confirmed  though that there is an easter egg to  squeeze toy aliens in the first  mid-credits scene where you can see a  little statue of one of the green men on  commander burnside shelf and if you're a  fan of the hilarious little green men or  you're enjoying this video so far do  leave a thumbs up i really appreciate it  when zerg confronts buzz for the first  time and corners him buzz is saved when  the junior's at patrol blasts the  villain to the floor as zerg recovers he  uses his arm controls to call on a team  of cyclops to help him trap buzz the  original storyboard for this sequence  reveals a hilarious little deleted  moment where the zerg bots can be seen  chilling out in a lounge on the ship  playing cards and pool together just  before zerg's command activates them  also cut from the final movie was a  scene involving 